		<string text=""/>
		<string text="Each frame ends just before the screen's refresh:\nless delay. BOOST can lower fps on a weak GPU."/>
		<string text="How far the game draws. Bigger maps can need more."/>
		<string text="Lowers the 3D resolution when the game runs\nslower than this, and never limits frame rate."/>
		<string text="The most sparks, smoke and debris alive at once.\nFewer is easier on the PC."/>
		<string text="The most muzzle flashes, plasma and explosions\nthat light the level at once."/>
		<string text="The least time a campaign level's loading screen\nstays up."/>
		<string text="The least time any other game's loading screen\nstays up. Network games wait for it."/>
